# Apple notarization credentials. Loaded ONLY by `bash scripts/release-desktop.sh`.
# Kept separate from per-app .env files so day-to-day `bun run desktop build`
# stays fast — Tauri's bundler auto-notarizes the .app whenever these are in
# scope, which adds 5–20min of waiting on Apple's notary queue. We only want
# that on actual releases.
#
# Copy to .env.release (gitignored) and fill in:
#
#   APPLE_ID         your Apple Developer account email.
#   APPLE_PASSWORD   app-specific password (NOT your Apple ID password).
#                    Create at https://account.apple.com → Sign-In and
#                    Security → App-Specific Passwords. Format:
#                    xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx.
#   APPLE_TEAM_ID    10-character Team ID. Visible in your Developer ID cert
#                    string and at https://developer.apple.com/account.

APPLE_ID=
APPLE_PASSWORD=
APPLE_TEAM_ID=
